// Article 4. The board.
#require "3-meetings.charter".
Placeholder candidate For person
Placeholder incumbent For person

Fact choice Identified by person * office * candidate
Act vote-for Actor person Recipient candidate Related to office
  Holds when member(person) && present(person) && member(candidate)
  Valid when member(person) && present(person) && member(candidate)
  Creates choice(person, office, candidate)
  Terminates (Foreach candidate': choice(person, office, candidate'))
Extend Event meeting-ends Terminates (Foreach choice: choice)
Fact leads Identified by office * candidate
  Holds when Count(Foreach person: person When choice(person, office, candidate)) > 0
    && !(Exists candidate': candidate' != candidate
           && Count(Foreach person: person When choice(person, office, candidate'))
                >= Count(Foreach person: person When choice(person, office, candidate)))
Power elect Actor club Recipient candidate Related to office
  Valid when quorum && leads(office, candidate)
    && !(Exists office': office' != office && officer(office', candidate))
  Creates officer(office, candidate) For 365 days

Use motion(incumbent) As removal From 4.4
Power remove Actor club Recipient incumbent
  Valid when removal-two-thirds(incumbent)
  Terminates (Foreach office: officer(office, incumbent))

Clause 4.1/1 Definition => office
Clause 4.1/2 => elect
Clause 4.2/1 => vote-for, elect
Clause 4.2/2 => leads, elect
Clause 4.3 => officer, elect
Clause 4.4 => removal-vote-aye, removal-vote-nay, remove.
